Hello..

An easy way to rob out shops, especially if you have no money and no
tripe-ration to train your pet, is to go into a shop, let your pet
follow and wait until the pet picks up an object. Now you should as
fast as possible leave the shop, the pet will normally follow you and
a few steps later it will drop the object outsite of the job. Works
fine with all objects, except heavy armor. Normally, with this method,
I get every object I want to have. But you have to make it easy for
your pet to get the wished object, therefor you should drop the object
not so far away from the door, where you wait..

ciao, Hermann Behrens
